{%- comment -%}
  Fonts and styles for the Vates sections, rendered once from layout/theme.liquid.

  This used to be emitted by every Vates section (see snippets/vates-head.liquid).
  The homepage runs eight of them, so the same render-blocking stylesheet link
  and the same pair of preconnects were parsed eight times, in the body, where a
  stylesheet blocks rendering of everything after it. One copy, in the head,
  costs the same bytes and none of the blocking.

  vates-courage.css comes second on purpose. It is a companion to
  vates-home.css rather than a replacement: it adds the statement
  scale the courage repositioning needs, and restates a handful of
  .vt-hero and .vt-product properties that were sized for the old
  module layout. Those restatements win on source order, so the two
  files must stay in this order.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link
  rel="stylesheet"
  href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,300;9..144,400;9..144,500&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
>
{{ 'vates-home.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'vates-courage.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
